WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.441
In Clients, open the more menu and choose
Import clients.

00:00:05.291 --> 00:00:09.351
The app may first ask you to review the
requirements for the information you'll
keep.

00:00:10.251 --> 00:00:11.564
Read that before continuing.

00:00:12.814 --> 00:00:14.563
This example uses pasted text.

00:00:15.663 --> 00:00:21.825
Tap Analyze and check each proposed client,
address, duration and appointment window
against the original.

00:00:23.025 --> 00:00:24.146
Check the visit days as well.

00:00:25.046 --> 00:00:29.636
A visit is only planned on a day that's
both a client visit day and one of your
work days.

00:00:30.936 --> 00:00:35.690
Apply the import when the details are
right, then read the result and check the
clients you've saved.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:41.053
An import is a starting plan for you to
review, not confirmation of an appointment.
